## Next steps

After this design is approved, QG-F1 (blocking) can be evaluated. Foundation is complete. Downstream phases:

1. **P3.2 Module skills** — pricing-page work + per-seat / per-resource billing can now safely reference per-tenant cost data.
2. **Operations** — wire the alert channels (slack / pagerduty / email integrations); confirm the instrumentation hooks land in production telemetry.
3. **Revisit triggers** — if gross margin slips below `gross_margin_target_pct - 10%` for two consecutive quarters, OR if any upstream Foundation artifact changes, re-run this workflow in Edit mode (revalidates coherence + may revise ceilings).
